CHAPTER.VERS:
Riches and honour [are] with me; 

          Signifying that he chiefly means the spiritual treasures and heavenly riches.
         durable riches and righteousness.

Then I was by him, 

          Some read, a chief worker signifying that this wisdom, Christ Jesus, was equal with God his father, and created, preserves and still works with him, as in (Joh_5:17).
         [as] one brought up [with him]: and I was daily [his] delight, rejoicing always before him;
